## Tour lifecycle FSM (frozen — P5-B-N-003)

Pure transition matrix enforced in `apps/api/src/canonical/assert-tour-lifecycle-transition.ts` using the workspace plugin `lifecycle` contract (package path) or metadata adapter overlay (pilot path).

| From | To | Allowed (Denali v1) | Assert |
|------|-----|---------------------|--------|
| `DRAFT` | `OPEN` | Yes — publish | LC-01 |
| `OPEN` | `DRAFT` | No | LC-02 |
| `CANCELLED` | any | No — terminal | LC-03 |
| `OPEN` | `CLOSED` | Legacy yes — deferred to plugin lifecycle expansion | — |

Denali package declares `DENALI_LIFECYCLE` (`initialStatus: DRAFT`, `publishStatus: OPEN`, single edge `DRAFT→OPEN`). Canonical `publishStatus` (`draft`/`active`) maps via workspace bindings — lifecycle assert runs on **logical** lifecycle states before publish gates (N-004).

```typescript
assertTourLifecycleTransition({
  lifecycle: plugin.lifecycle,
  fromStatus: "DRAFT",
  toStatus: "OPEN",
}); // LC-01 pass

assertTourLifecycleTransition({
  lifecycle: plugin.lifecycle,
  fromStatus: "OPEN",
  toStatus: "DRAFT",
}); // LC-02 throws TOUR_LIFECYCLE_TRANSITION_REJECTED
```

Spec: `apps/api/test/tour-lifecycle-transition.spec.ts`.

