## Golden metadata path (frozen — P5-B-N-006)

End-to-end proof that a tenant on the metadata path (`WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED=true` + binding to committed `denali-v1.json` / `denali-tour-ops` v1) matches package behavior for operator publish workflows:

```text
resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantContext(tenantId, "denali")
  → loadPublishedVersion(denali-tour-ops, 1) from denali-v1.json seed
  → adaptMetadataPayloadToWorkspacePlugin(payload, package overlay)
  → PlatformWizardEngine + publish lifecycle assert
```

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| RP-01 | Flag + binding + seed payload — golden `tour-publish-ready` publish gate passes (metadata ≡ package) |
| RP-02 | Render plan ordered `fieldId` lists match package path |
| RP-03 | Render plan `uiHints.compositeId` values match package path |
| RP-04 | Golden tour `publishStatus` draft→active passes lifecycle assert on metadata plugin overlay |

Package overlay preserves `validation`, `lifecycle`, and `wizardHost` hooks while fieldRegistry/ruleSet/wizard come from metadata payload.

`parseWorkspaceDefinitionExportFile` guards `assertWorkspaceDefinitionPayload` when workspace-sdk dist is stale (same pattern as `load-workspace-plugin-for-tenant.ts`).

Spec: `apps/api/test/workspace-metadata-denali-parity-publish.spec.ts` (RP-01..04). Render-plan-only asserts also live in `workspace-metadata-render-plan-parity.spec.ts`.

