## Catalog ref integrity (frozen — P5-B-N-008)

On Denali **publish** validation, server rejects stale catalog references before persist — parity with client submit sanitize (themes + selectable leaders):

```text
validateCanonicalBeforePersist
  → enrich catalogRefAllowlists (tenant themes + leader directory)
  → validateCanonicalDocumentWithEngine
  → assertCatalogRefIntegrity when validationMode === publish
```

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| VAL-03 | Stale `program.themeIds` entry fails with `CATALOG_REF_INTEGRITY_FAILED` |
| VAL-03b | Stale `leaderUserIds` entry fails |
| VAL-03c | Valid refs pass |
| VAL-03d | `resolveDenaliCatalogRefAllowlists` loads active themes + selectable leaders |
| VAL-03e..f | Wired in `canonical-validation-sync.ts` + `canonical-validation.ts` enrich |

Implementation: `assert-catalog-ref-integrity.ts` · `resolve-denali-catalog-ref-allowlists.ts`.

Spec: `apps/api/test/catalog-ref-integrity.spec.ts`.

Note: N-005 metadata publish-gate parity test is labeled **VAL-03m** in `canonical-validation-draft-vs-publish.spec.ts` to avoid ID collision with catalog band.

