## Operator web plugin resolve (frozen — P5-B-N-009)

Operator wizard resolves workspace plugin through a Strangler Fig facade mirroring API `resolveWorkspacePluginForTenant`:

```text
resolveOperatorWorkspacePlugin
  → package loader (registry) when flag off OR binding null OR tenant ∉ allowlist
  → metadata payload loader + adaptMetadataPayloadToWorkspacePlugin when flag + binding active
```

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| WEB-01 | `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED` + tenant binding → injectable metadata loader + adapter merge |
| WEB-02 | No binding (or flag off) → package plugin unchanged; metadata loader not invoked |
| WEB-03 | `WorkspaceWizardHost` loads plugin through `loadOperatorWorkspacePlugin` (optional `metadataBinding` prop) |

Web-local adapter (`adapt-metadata-payload-to-workspace-plugin.ts`) mirrors API overlay merge — fieldRegistry/ruleSet/wizard from metadata; validation/lifecycle/wizardHost hooks from package.

Env parity with API: `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED`, `WORKSPACE_METADATA_TENANT_ALLOWLIST`.

Implementation: `resolve-operator-workspace-plugin.ts` · `adapt-metadata-payload-to-workspace-plugin.ts` · wired in `WorkspaceWizardHost` via `loadOperatorWorkspacePlugin`.

Spec: `apps/web/test/operator-metadata-plugin-resolve.spec.ts` (WEB-01..02).

