## PATCH audit (frozen — P5-B-N-011)

Extends DEC-007 create-only audit to successful tour PATCH on forensic (Prisma) path:

```text
PATCH /tours/:id
  → CanonicalTourService.updateTour
  → persistTourUpdateAtomically
  → appendTourUpdatedAuditEvent (TOUR_UPDATED, same TX as tour row)
```

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| AUD-02 | `appendTourUpdatedAuditEvent` writes `TOUR_UPDATED` with tenant ALS + pseudonymized actor |
| AUD-02b | Atomic update path calls helper (not raw duplicate append) |
| AUD-02c | `guard:tour-update-audit` locks helper wiring |

Memory driver remains non-forensic (no audit row by design).

Implementation: `appendTourUpdatedAuditEvent` in `audit-logger.ts` · wired in `atomic-canonical-tour-persist.ts`.

Spec: `apps/api/test/tour-patch-audit.spec.ts` (AUD-02..02c).

