## Publish audit (frozen — P5-B-N-012)

Publish/unpublish transitions append dedicated audit rows in the same forensic TX as `TOUR_UPDATED`:

```text
persistTourUpdateAtomically
  → appendTourUpdatedAuditEvent (always on PATCH success)
  → detectTourPublishTransition
  → appendTourPublishTransitionAuditEvent (TOUR_PUBLISHED | TOUR_UNPUBLISHED + from/to status)
```

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| AUD-03 | `transition: published` → `TOUR_PUBLISHED` + `fromPublishStatus` / `toPublishStatus` metadata |
| AUD-03b | `transition: unpublished` → `TOUR_UNPUBLISHED` |
| AUD-03c | Atomic update path invokes helper after transition detect |

Implementation: `appendTourPublishTransitionAuditEvent` in `audit-logger.ts` · wired in `atomic-canonical-tour-persist.ts`.

Spec: `apps/api/test/tour-publish-audit.spec.ts` (AUD-03..03c).

